WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:16.199
Kip walked toward the playground.

2
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.253
Bird walked toward the beach.

3
00:00:19.254 --> 00:00:25.996
Goose was alone.

4
00:00:25.997 --> 00:00:34.290
Goose waddled to the pond.

5
00:00:34.291 --> 00:00:37.399
She swam in the water.

6
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:44.684
Soon Bird and Kip came over.

7
00:00:44.685 --> 00:00:47.106
"Goose!" called Bird.

8
00:00:47.107 --> 00:00:49.682
"What are you doing?

9
00:00:49.683 --> 00:00:52.356
We're going to the beach."

10
00:00:52.357 --> 00:00:55.373
"No, we're not," said Kip.

11
00:00:55.374 --> 00:00:59.584
"We're going to the playground!"

12
00:00:59.585 --> 00:01:03.726
"Come closer," said Goose.

13
00:01:03.727 --> 00:01:09.039
Bird and Kip went closer to the pond.

14
00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:12.372
"Closer," said Goose.

15
00:01:12.373 --> 00:01:15.742
They went even closer.

16
00:01:15.743 --> 00:01:19.228
"Show me your lists," said Goose.

17
00:01:19.229 --> 00:01:21.903
Bird and Kip held up their lists.

18
00:01:21.904 --> 00:01:24.162
Splash! Splash!

19
00:01:24.163 --> 00:01:27.129
Goose splashed water all over.

20
00:01:27.130 --> 00:01:29.536
Bird and Kip were soaked.

21
00:01:29.537 --> 00:01:32.653
And so were their lists.

22
00:01:32.654 --> 00:01:36.987
"My list is ruined!" cried Kip.

23
00:01:36.988 --> 00:01:40.373
"Mine is too!" cried Bird.

24
00:01:40.374 --> 00:01:46.390
Goose smiled. "Honk!"

25
00:01:46.391 --> 00:01:50.352
Bird and Kip smiled.

26
00:01:50.353 --> 00:01:53.171
Bird and Kip splashed Goose.

27
00:01:53.172 --> 00:01:58.836
Everyone splashed each other.

28
00:01:58.837 --> 00:02:01.783
The three friends laughed.

29
00:02:01.784 --> 00:02:05.957
"This is fun!" said Goose.
